{#-
  Shared document shell.

  Autoescape is on for this environment, so every {{ value }} below is escaped by Jinja.
  Nothing in the site is ever marked safe. The CSP is deliberately restrictive: with
  default-src 'none' the page cannot reach any origin at all, and script-src/style-src
  'self' allows only the two files this generator wrote beside it. frame-ancestors is
  deliberately absent: a browser ignores it in a meta element and logs an error for it.
-#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>{% block title %}VC Scout{% endblock %}</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ stylesheet }}">
</head>
<body>
{% block chrome %}{% endblock %}
<main id="main">
<div class="wrap">
{% block main %}{% endblock %}
</div>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
<div class="wrap">
<p>Generated by VC Scout from persisted run artifacts. Scores are recomputed in Python from the analysis model&#39;s per-dimension components; research confidence and the final recommendation are produced by deterministic policy, not by a model.</p>
</div>
</footer>
{% block scripts %}{% endblock %}
</body>
</html>
